title: "GENCO meets the neutral wire: four-wire dynamic operating envelopes for low-voltage grids"
abstract: >-
  Extending the GENCO grid foundation model to three-phase four-wire low-voltage networks for dynamic
  operating envelopes, with a full four-wire OpenDSS check. GridFM GENCO Challenge 2026 entry.
